
//Dark Skies DLC - Broken Earth

TITechTemplate.displayName.BSBE_ANewSpaceRace=A New Space Race
TITechTemplate.quote.BSBE_ANewSpaceRace="The Roman Empire took nearly as long to fall as it did to build. They bent and creaked and snapped under the weight of overreach. Learn from their hubris, and devise a way for us to extend further without breaking apart."<br/><align=right>{destroyLeader}<align=left><br/><align=right>Staff Meeting with Humanity First Logistics Command</i><align=left>
TITechTemplate.summary.BSBE_ANewSpaceRace=Mankind takes a giant leap back into space. 
TITechTemplate.description.BSBE_ANewSpaceRace=Long ago, before the Winter War, great nations competed to see who could go further, dream bigger, who could capture the imagination and promise the brighter future. Of course, it was all a farce. Not far beneath the veneer of progress were ugly societies led by madmen who gambled with chips that were not theirs. The very same technology that put their ideals into orbit was intended to deliver mass slaughter to their neighbors. Every generation thereafter has lived only to repair what was vandalized. History has once again begun to move quickly, and we once again hurry into space. Not because it is easy, nor because our ego demands it, but because we must.
